### 1. CREATE Task (POST)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Finish REST API Assignment",
  "description": "Complete code, video, and report",
  "dueDate": "2026-08-20"
}

### 2. READ ALL Tasks (GET)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/tasks

### 3. READ ALL Tasks with Filter (GET)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/tasks?completed=false

### 4. READ INDIVIDUAL Task (GET)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/tasks/660000000000000000000000

### 5. UPDATE Task (PUT)
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/tasks/660000000000000000000000
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Finish REST API Assignment - UPDATED",
  "isCompleted": true
}

### 6. DELETE Task (DELETE)
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/tasks/660000000000000000000000